    <p class="doc-lede">Four routes, trading off cost, speed, and identity. Whichever you pick, the purchase ends only when the coins sit in a wallet you control.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="doc-grid">
  <div>
    <div class="by-steps">
      <div class="by-step"><span class="by-sn">01</span><b>Wallet first</b><i>Set one up before you spend anything</i></div>
      <div class="by-step"><span class="by-sn">02</span><b>Pick a route</b><i>Exchange, peer to peer, ATM, or earn it</i></div>
      <div class="by-step"><span class="by-sn">03</span><b>Buy</b><i>Check the quote against the market rate</i></div>
      <div class="by-step"><span class="by-sn">04</span><b>Withdraw</b><i>Move the coins to your own wallet</i></div>
